OL,3,CWhen Meridian met Nims Dai - the
OL,4,Cmountaineer who relished life on the
OL,5,Cedge
OL,7,FWatch: ITV Meridian's Rachel Hepworth
OL,8,Finterviewed Nims Dai in 2021, when he
OL,9,Freturned home to Hampshire during a
OL,10,Fbreak between expeditions.
OL,12,FThe mountaineering world has been
OL,13,Fpaying tribute to the renowned British-
OL,14,FNepali climber and nine other
OL,15,Fclimbers, who were swept away by an
OL,16,Favalanche in Pakistan.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/2
