OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785745097
OL,3,CWhen Meridian met Nims Dai - the
OL,4,Cmountaineer who relished life on the
OL,5,Cedge
OL,7,FFilmed on a trip to St Catherine's
OL,8,FHill in Winchester, Nims spoke of his
OL,9,Flove of the mountains, his
OL,10,Frelationship with risk, and his joy at
OL,11,Ffeeling most alive in the face of
OL,12,Fadversity.
OL,14,FThe 43 year old, who was married with
OL,15,Fone daughter, lived in Eastleigh and
OL,16,Fwas a much-loved member of the local
OL,17,FNepali community.
